    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Instant Personalized <span class="search-hit mathjax">Large</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Adaptation via Hypernetwork
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tan%2C+Z">Zhaoxuan Tan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+Z">Zixuan Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wen%2C+H">Haoyang Wen</a>, 
      
