        Fusion-Augmented <span class="search-hit mathjax">Large</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>: Boosting Diagnostic Trustworthiness via <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Consensus
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
