        Lightweight CycleGAN <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Cross-Modality Image <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformation</span> and Experimental Quality Assessment in Fluorescence Microscopy
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Soltaninezhad%2C+M">Mohammad Soltaninezhad</a>, 
      
