        A Feasibility Study on Usability and Trust among Population Groups of a Medical Avatar Supported by <span class="search-hit mathjax">Large</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> with Retrieval Augmented Generation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
