    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        You May Speak Freely: Improving the Fine-Grained Visual Recognition Capabilities of Multimodal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Large</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> with Answer Extraction
      
